# Warp Generator — Cursor Rules (v1.0.0 stable)

Single-file Cloudflare Worker. All runtime logic is in `_worker.js` (~6700 lines) + `html/` inlined via `String.raw`. Do NOT split into modules. Tag `v*.*.*` is version truth (`package.json` ↔ `_worker.js:VERSION` via `scripts/check-version.mjs`).

## Stack

- Workers ES2022, `nodejs_compat`, Cache API (`caches.default`) + KV (`WARP_KV` `403f8a13…`)
- Deps: bcryptjs (legacy migration only), @noble/curves, fflate, js-yaml (lineWidth -1)
- Constraints: 10 ms CPU free, no Node at runtime, workerd rejects non-function exports → use `testHooks()`

## Style

- camelCase funcs/vars, UPPER_SNAKE consts, async/await, early returns, explicit error handling
- Routes: add to `ROUTES` (`_worker.js:6790`) — `dispatchRequest` handles auth/405/501/404
- Formats: add to `FORMATS` (`_worker.js:6430`) — sync `SUB_FORMATS` in dashboard, `npm run goldens:update`
- KV: always `kvGet`/`kvPut`/`kvDelete` and check `null`/`false`
- Cache: `origin + /sub/{token}/{format}` via `caches.default`; purge via `purgeCachedSubscriptions` / `purgeAllCachedSubscriptions` (includes `agg:{token}`)
- Exports: plain helpers directly, constants via `testHooks()`; no CDN in admin HTML

## KV Keys

- `account:{uuid}` — Account (additive: `dns`, `group`, `tokenMeta`, `fetchCount`)
- `token:{token}` — Token → uuid
- `agg:{token}` — Aggregate `{token, groups[], label?, tokenMeta?}`
- `session:{token}` — Session TTL 24h
- `auth:fail:{ip}` — 5 fails / 900 s → 429
- `settings:password` — PBKDF2/bcrypt
- `settings:global` — `{amnezia}`
- `settings:warpstatus` — `{ok, checkedAt, lastError}`
- `presets` — Preset array (`dns`, `preferredOrder`)
- `cache:*` — removed v1.0.0, abandoned

## Validation (SPEC.md AC11 + addendum)

- Name 1-100 chars no control; Config 100B-10KB; Private key base64 32B no whitespace
- IP: strict IPv4/IPv6/domain 253 chars; Port 1-65535; DNS IP/domain; Endpoints 1-200
- Password 8-128 chars (72B cap); Token label 1-100, expiresAt future ISO, group sanitized
- Amnezia Jc 0-128, Jmin/Jmax 0-1280 Jmin≤Jmax, S 0-255, H 0-2147483647 or lo-hi non-overlapping

## Never

- Store passwords plaintext; log private keys/tokens (warp client redacts)
- Trust input; add dep without bundle check; hand-edit `test/golden/*`
- Add non-function named exports (workerd rejects) — use `testHooks()`
- Skip `node --check _worker.js` + `npm test` + `scripts/check-version.mjs` before handoff

